#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0276 expect=skipped domain=BW
#note "Library-dependency boundary: the Check reads var_name(\"LIBRARY\") / var_label(\"LIBRARY\"), so a run with no Library access at all (no #library line) SKIPS rather than judging labels against nothing (the CDISC-CG0303 / CG0359 shape). The body is the invalid one (BWTESTCD sponsor label)."
dataset BW class=FINDINGS label="Body Weights"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col BWTESTCD type=Char label="Body Weight Test Code"
---
S1 | BW | S1-001 | 1 | BW
